From 7438fbec8edc175473e5c007acd8491acecb5cc2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maintainer <mail@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 16:03:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: multi-category support for recipes

Allows assigning a recipe to multiple categories instead of just one.

Backend:
- RecipeDb.php: multi-category DB operations
- DbCacheService.php: diff-based category update
- CleanCategoryFilter.php: keep category array instead of reducing to one

Frontend:
- RecipeEdit.vue: multi-select UI for categories

Patched against upstream v0.11.6. Upstream rejects this feature
(PR #3080 actively removed multi-select), so maintained as a private fork.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
